WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.550
Huh?

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.120
The Mirror Lovies!

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.120
Give it a try!

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:24.910
The princess!

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.030
Princess Ann!

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.870
It has been some time, Cure Sword.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.550
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.580
Every day it sparkles

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:55.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:26.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.210
What's more than just cute

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.070
is our promise between girls

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:46.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:52.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:04.040
Ai's Being Stubborn!

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:04.040
Ai's Being Stubborn!

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.280
Even now, I am yet unable to awaken from my icy prison.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:13.430
I may have little power left in me,

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.720
but there is one thing that I simply must tell you.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.190
What is it that you must tell us, Princess?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.390
It's about the infant you're raising, Ai.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.990
Princess, it's an honor to meet you!

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:32.250
I'm Oogai First Middle School's student council president, Aida Mana!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.780
Princess, you're familiar with Ai?

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.360
But your fiancé, Jonathan Klondike,

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.810
told us he had found Ai's egg by a river!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.310
Shh!

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.280
You could wake Ai!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:54.320
She has two duties to fulfill.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:58.800
Her first is to act as a fairy to grant the Precures power.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.260
And her second...

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.230
is to act as a shield to repel the power of darkness.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.610
A shield?

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:10.870
The Selfish can take hold of any human.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:14.040
By expanding the self-centered, egotistical part of their hearts,

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.500
they can increase their numbers, as I'm sure you're aware.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.080
Yes... Charles told us.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.040
Kyupirappa!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:28.430
Ai can use the power of light to repel the source of the Selfish's power, Egogy.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.580
Ai has such a wondrous power?

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.860
I can't believe it!

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.430
Should that shield's power deteriorate,

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:39.330
the Selfishes would attack with ever-increasing vigor!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.310
I believe you've already seen the effects yourself.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.020
We did!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.850
So that <i>was</i> why Ira and Mammo grew so powerful!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.550
But why did Ai's power deteriorate all of a sudden?

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.750
Because she's entered her grumpy phase.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.490
Her grumpy phase?

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.720
When babies first begin to assert themselves.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:09.000
"I hate this, I hate that," they selfishly cry, bringing much grief to their parents.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:14.070
But it's an essential step towards adulthood that all babies must take.

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:17.540
True, my mother said something like that...

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:21.820
The deciding factor between her growing to be a happy, energetic child,

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.350
or a self-centered, egotistical one...

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.560
will be how you raise her.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.000
Please, wait!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.050
What'll happen if Ai turns into a selfish child?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:36.030
Her mysterious power will vanish, and the shield will be no more.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.000
Oh no!

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.920
Please...

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:44.250
Please, raise Ai with...

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.520
She is the world's final h...

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.520
Wait, Princess!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.070
There's more I want to ask you!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.350
She's gone...

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.380
Princess...

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.430
L-Lemme go!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.080
Lance!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.390
What happened?!

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:06.930
I need help!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:12.690
C'mon, why're you all shaken up over a little nibble?

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.680
That was no nibble!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:17.620
That hurt way more than normal!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.660
Don't tell me...

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.110
So she is!

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:24.080
What is it?

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.370
Look here...

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:28.350
Is that a...

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.750
Ah! Ai grew a tooth!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.710
How cute!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.030
Hey, how 'bout stoppin' to breathe?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:52.230
But I'm still hungry no matter how much I eat!

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.850
It must be because of this ring.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.170
Thanks to all the power it saps,

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:59.640
I feel like I need to stuff myself to compensate!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:04.620
That Blood Ring of yours had to be made from Gula's Egogy.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.590
Oh no, it won't come off!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:16.600
But man, that power we got was something else.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.910
Doubt it came from this.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:28.160
Maybe Bel was right about it coming from the baby?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.750
You're <i>still</i> eating?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.690
There's always room for dessert!

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:36.210
Don't come cryin' to me when you get Gula's gut.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.210
... You're right.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.920
Then perhaps I should burn some calories.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.830
A match against the Precures...

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.160
sounds like excellent cardio.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.600
Look, Ai.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:52.330
Solitaire

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:52.330
After you eat, you're supposed to brush your teeth like this.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.000
Now you try too, Ai!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.580
Now say "Aaah."

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:01.560
Naw.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:06.490
If you don't brush your teeth, you'll get cavities!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.190
Naw, naw!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.430
Um, what's a cavity?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.950
You... don't know?

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:17.750
Cavities happen when bacteria in your mouth form tooth-dissolving plaque. {It's worded somewhat differently in Japanese, but I'm using my knowledge of toothpaste commercials to localize this into something others might be more familiar with.}

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.720
They're a nightmare!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.860
It melts your teeth?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.310
The human world has such terrifying illnesses... {I use "illness" here to show Davi's unfamiliarity with the condition. Also why I don't use "illness" for Rikka.}

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:29.450
If you only eat sweets, you're bound to get them.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.610
Are your teeth fine, Aguri?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.520
You've no need to worry.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.740
I brush my teeth every day!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.400
