00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.860
A performer's teeth are her life!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.710
You'll be fired from being an idol!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:35.870
You jerks!

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.470
I've <i>been</i> brushing!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.880
There are right and wrong ways to brush your teeth, you know.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.370
If you miss a spot, you'll get cavities.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.440
Really?

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.360
Though there's no point in fussing now that you already have one.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.450
We'll simply go to the dentist and have him fix you.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:52.410
Dentist?

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.110
We'll have Ai watch along.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.530
Naw, naw!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.680
Times like these...

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.160
Call for this!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.810
Lancece!

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:21.750
Here, Ai!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.610
This'll make you feel better!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.350
So, cavities are curable. {"Cure" is the same deal as the aforementioned "illness."}

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:37.790
That's a relief.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.860
I don't think I could deal with this pain forever.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.070
It's too early to relax.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.720
The true terror of cavities...

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.840
lies in that office.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.960
Wh-What's he doing?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.610
He's drilling his tooth.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.680
Drilling his tooth?!

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.640
What's that?

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.650
Pliers.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.720
I can see that they're pliers!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.620
I'm asking what he's gonna use them for!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:11.260
If the pain doesn't go away, they have to remove your wisdom teeth.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:14.160
Remove your teeth?!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.280
Hello.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:15.900
Hello!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:20.300
Now, we'll begin treating your cavity.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.830
Open your mouth wide and show us your teeth.

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:32.310
Tell me if it hurts.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:36.680
I'm fine, really!

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.530
Wha...

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.220
Makopi!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.160
Makopi...

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:10.880
Makopi...

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.960
Why did you run away?

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.720
Doesn't your tooth hurt?

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.570
Cavities don't heal when left alone.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.400
Now, let's return and have your cavity treated.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:21.550
No!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.190
Makopi...

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.610
I'm scared... {Says the girl who fights two-story tall monsters every week.}

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:28.790
My knees start shaking as soon as I hear that drill rev up!

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.070
There, there...

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.940
How unbecoming, Makoto.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.850
You're no different from a selfish baby.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:46.270
The princess entrusted Ai to us, making us nothing short of mothers!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:49.950
And what kind of mother sets a poor example for her child?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:53.160
We're Ai's mothers?

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.920
Just as Aguri said.

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:59.300
The apple doesn't fall far from the tree, you know.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:01.550
Let's go back to the dentist.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:05.870
And let's show Ai the importance of dental hygiene!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:08.920
I'm sorry, girls...

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.180
You're right, Aguri.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:14.580
If I can't conquer a cavity, I can't call myself Ai's mother.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.650
And I can't let the princess down, either!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.140
I'll get my cavity treated!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.840
You go, Makopi!

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.430
Then let's go back to the dentist!

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.450
Makopi?

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.380
But it's <i>really</i> scary!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.250
It's so empty here...

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:42.250
If only more people had cavities, I'd get more business.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:47.570
Wait, I shouldn't even <i>think</i> that!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.360
I'm a doctor!

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.750
I should always hope for my patients' health!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.960
Oh, don't be so stiff...

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:58.560
W-Who's there?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.430
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

