Dentine hypersensitivity!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.190
Periodontitis!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.270
Mana, I felt a dark heartbeat!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.460
What?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.180
It came from the dentist's!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:51.250
Selfish!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.290
Is that...

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.490
A Selfish!

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:57.620
Girls, let's go!

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:00.960
Charles!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.900
Precure Love Link!

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:05.660
L-O-V-E!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:06.410
L-O-V-E!

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.070
L-O-V-E!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.110
L-O-V-E!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.000
Precure Dress Up!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.100
Kyupirappa!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.620
Brimming with love,

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.760
Cure Heart!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.020
The light of wisdom,

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.480
Cure Diamond!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.490
The warmth of the sun,

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.870
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.740
Love's trump card,

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.050
Cure Ace!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.200
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.550
Dokidoki—

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.650
Huh?

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.700
Makopi?

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:15.760
What's wrong?

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.560
Well... look!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:22.470
When I hear that sound, I get scared stiff!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:28.020
Aww, looks like I'll barely work up a sweat.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.450
Get them, Selfish!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.310
I'll make those teeth of yours clatter! {This is a shortening of a Kansai saying that translates to "Stick a finger in your butthole and make your teeth clatter," a phrase used to intimidate. This Selfish doesn't seem to have fingers, but he does have a drill...}

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:37.210
Drill!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.250
Self?

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:41.830
Self!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.300
Seeeelf!

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.240
Get offa me!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.010
Ow!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:00.210
Makoto!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.680
It's resonating with her cavity!

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.260
Ai started crying! {Oh for fuck's sake you retarded baby}

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:11.710
That's not a good sign!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.790
Selfish!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.400
Now this, I don't mind!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.430
Selfish, destroy them!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.090
Light Arm!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.230
It's bright!

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:27.230
Water Arm!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.940
Dryer Arm!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.790
Not your best look.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.060
Selfish, turn them into Swiss cheese!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.250
Drill Arm!

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:02.750
Why did she get so ludicrously strong?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.470
Because Ai's shield disappeared.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.640
It's my fault.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.310
All because I got this stupid cavity...

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.320
Makoto...

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.150
Stay strong!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:19.630
Do you not have a duty to restore Trump Kingdom?

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.090
You must not give in now!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:26.750
Plant your feet on the ground and take a stand!

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:29.530
Princess!

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.470
Grit those teeth!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.940
Davi, if you'd please.

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.190
Thought you'd never ask!

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:43.840
Precure Love Link!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:44.550
L-O-V-E!

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:45.210
L-O-V-E!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:45.990
L-O-V-E!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.180
L-O-V-E!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.460
Drill!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.100
Cure Sword!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.410
You're <i>kidding</i>!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.580
The blade of courage, Cure Sword!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:21.150
I shall sever your ambitions with the blade of love!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:35.850
Ai.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.480
I won't lose to a silly cavity anymore!

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:42.430
So let's fight together!

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.340
Self...

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.810
Wait, what now?

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:53.250
Eye for an eye and a tooth for a tooth!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.880
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:04.120
Sword Hurricane! {This sounds cooler than the balloon and swirkle combined.}

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.130
Let's go, everyone!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:30.150
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:46.360
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:58.830
Love love looooove!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:14.670
I'll remember this!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.680
Cure Sword, excellent work!

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:24.980
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:26.500
To me?

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:31.260
Your words made me feel as though the princess herself was encouraging me.

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.290
That's what let me fight with all I had.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.320
Thank you!

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.520
How curious.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.550
When I saw Princess Ann reflected in the mirror,

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.090
I felt as though it wasn't our first meeting...

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:48.060
As though I had known her long ago...

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:49.600
Really?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.610
It's but a feeling.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:57.170
Let's restore Trump Kingdom ourselves!

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.500
I don't want you laughing at me, so I got my cavity fixed!

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:04.330
Look!

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:10.950
Let's brush our teeth to make sure we never get cavities again!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.790
Could that light be...

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.800
Pajama Lovies!

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:28.720
Let's use it right away!

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.240
Dibbity dobbity Davi!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:42.480
Look at that!

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:46.150
It's a pajama toothbrush set made just for Ai!

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.990
Ai!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.100
She seems to like it!

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.090
Great!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.160
I'll finish it for you.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:05.550
{ED}

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.730
Ah, my heart just won't stop racing...

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:13.010
