00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:20.160
Could that be...

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:21.710
Lovesickness, perhaps?

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:24.060
No way, couldn't— whaaaa?!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:26.050
Rachel, you've got a crush?!

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.520
Rachel's on Cloud Nine!

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.520
Rachel's on Cloud Nine!

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:34.000
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
